 ### 0.19.0 {small}`the-future`
 
+```{rubric} Bug fixes
+```
+* Align `dc.gsea` and `dc.zscore` with `decoupler` 2.3.1: GSEA permutation p-values are now `(k+1)/(n+1)` and the `KSEA`/`RoKAI` flavors of `zscore` are no longer swapped {pr}`864` {smaller}`S Dicks`
+* Fix `dc.waggr` p-values: they are now two-sided empirical p-values `(k+1)/(n+1)` that count the observed score as one permutation, so they are never 0 {pr}`855` {smaller}`S Dicks`
+
 ```{rubric} Misc
 ```
 * Switch the documentation theme from `scanpydoc` to the shared scverse theme `scverse-doc` {pr}`856` {smaller}`S Dicks`
